// 1-9: swing onto a ledge (or zip in mid-swing), drive a short rail, swing to the perch and zip onto it, pull up the cliff.
id l1-09
name 1-9 LAST HOP
tagline everything you know, over everything that hurts.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main anchor pull
mechanics current:3 pull:3 anchor:2 yank:1
new -
portion 6 pull to the anchor
portion 6 swing, rail, swing
portion 6 last hop to the exit
hardness 6
